    ❌ (c) REDISTRIBUTE. Redistribute, republish, mirror, re-host,
           sublicense, lease, rent, sell, resell, transfer, or otherwise
           make available the ToCodex Binary Distribution to any third
           party — whether for free or for a fee, whether in original
