           source under Apache-2.0 per Section B and distribute Your own
           build under Apache-2.0.)

    ❌ (d) REMOVE NOTICES. Remove, alter, obscure, or replace any
           copyright notice, trademark, branding, attribution, license
           text, or proprietary marking contained in the ToCodex Binary
           Distribution.

    ❌ (e) CIRCUMVENT. Bypass, disable, or circumvent any license
           enforcement, activation, telemetry, access control, or
